# Datasets and checkpoints are deliberately not committed.
#
# Every run records its full provenance in metrics.json (seeds, mechanism, the
# Nyquist cap, the split audit) and every sample's generator parameters in
# splits.json, so `dataset_*.npz` and `best_model.pt` are reproducible with
#   python deeponet_smoother.py --data-dir level_data/L3 --out-dir <dir> ...
# and can be regenerated byte-for-byte for the same seed. Committing ~12 MB per
# run would bloat the repository for no gain.
#
# What IS committed per run: metrics.json, history.csv, splits.json, run.log and
# plots/ -- i.e. every number and figure quoted in DEEPONET_SMOOTHER.md.
*.npz
*.pt
